1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:02,210
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:03,440
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:05,240
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:07,980
(Episode 98)

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,180
How did it go?

6
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,990
Luckily, I can take care
of the CCTV footage.

7
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:17,960
I'll start securing
the area right away,

8
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:21,430
so go to his room
and finish him off.

9
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,400
The caregiver is on a break,
so no one will be there.

10
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,160
He's on a respirator,

11
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,000
so it'll be easy
if you just handle that.

12
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,970
Can I really trust you?

13
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:35,870
I should be the one asking you that.

14
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:39,810
You couldn't even finish off
Baek Jin Ju or Deputy Chief Yun.

15
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,880
But that's...

16
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:45,280
If Deputy Chief Yun wakes up,
Hyun Jun's life will be ruined.

17
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,050
And so will yours.

18
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,820
Our lives depend on
covering this up completely,

19
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:52,890
so quit doubting me and get moving.

20
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:54,090
All right.

21
00:00:55,090 --> 00:00:57,100
Just make sure
you take care of the CCTV.

22
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:07,610
If Choi Yu Na gets pinned
for killing Deputy Chief Yun,

23
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:11,180
then even if I'm the one
who secretly finishes him off,

24
00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:13,810
she takes the fall.

25
00:01:13,910 --> 00:01:15,280
Either way, I win.

26
00:01:17,350 --> 00:01:18,350
Choi Yu Na.

27
00:01:20,190 --> 00:01:21,650
I guess I won't be seeing you again.

28
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,370
You should've just died
then and there.

29
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,440
Why did you have to wake up
and cause so much trouble?

30
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:46,610
Now that I've made
Park Hyun Jun the chairman,

31
00:01:46,610 --> 00:01:47,850
I need to marry him soon.

32
00:01:49,110 --> 00:01:50,780
So stop causing me trouble...

33
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:52,020
and just die already.

34
00:01:53,050 --> 00:01:54,390
This time,
I won't make any mistakes.

35
00:01:55,650 --> 00:01:57,190
I'll finish you off in one go.

36
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:10,240
Choi Yu Na.

37
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,400
How are you two here?

38
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,680
Choi Yu Na.

39
00:02:21,810 --> 00:02:23,250
We heard your confession
loud and clear.

40
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:25,120
What?

41
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:26,820
It can't be...

42
00:02:27,090 --> 00:02:28,090
That's right.

43
00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:30,020
It was a trap,

44
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,060
and you're not getting away
this time.

45
00:02:33,860 --> 00:02:34,860
This can't be happening.

46
00:02:42,270 --> 00:02:44,270
Remember what you said to Jin Ju
at the shareholders' meeting?

47
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:47,770
"Even so,"

48
00:02:48,210 --> 00:02:51,340
"how could you try to kill someone?"

49
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:53,610
Park Min Jun.

50
00:02:54,110 --> 00:02:56,380
There's no way
you're getting away with this.

51
00:02:56,680 --> 00:02:57,850
This time,

52
00:02:58,250 --> 00:03:00,250
nobody's coming to save you.

53
00:03:22,470 --> 00:03:23,880
As long as we have
the slush fund ledger,

54
00:03:23,940 --> 00:03:25,410
Assemblyman Kwon has no choice.

55
00:03:25,810 --> 00:03:27,110
Now that I'm the chairman,

56
00:03:27,350 --> 00:03:29,210
if you give me the safe's code
like you promised,

57
00:03:29,410 --> 00:03:31,150
I'll get the ledger and go meet him.

58
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,920
We need to wrap this up
before the investigation gets out of hand.

59
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:40,660
He said he would hand over
the slush fund ledger,

60
00:03:41,430 --> 00:03:43,730
but is he having second thoughts
now that it's time?

61
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,970
I have to use this chance...

62
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:50,700
to get the slush fund ledger.

63
00:03:52,070 --> 00:03:55,640
That's the only way
I'll have any power.

64
00:04:02,450 --> 00:04:04,750
Why do you keep following me around?

65
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:07,250
I told you
I'd talk some sense into you.

66
00:04:08,790 --> 00:04:10,560
If once isn't enough,
I'll try twice, three times.

67
00:04:10,620 --> 00:04:13,220
I'll make you understand
and persuade you.

68
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:16,630
Choi Yu Na...

69
00:04:17,060 --> 00:04:18,260
was arrested.

70
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,270
Baek Jin Ju will be cleared
of all charges and released.

71
00:04:21,570 --> 00:04:24,640
So go to her now,

72
00:04:26,370 --> 00:04:28,470
apologize, and be with her.

73
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:33,680
I'm staying out
of Baek Jin Ju's business.

74
00:04:35,010 --> 00:04:36,880
So you should stay out of mine.

75
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,180
This way,
you'll lose the one you love...

76
00:04:39,180 --> 00:04:40,720
and regret it
for the rest of your life.

77
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:43,660
You won't be able to turn back
from this path,

78
00:04:44,020 --> 00:04:45,960
and you'll live in shame,
just like me.

79
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:48,630
Like you said,

80
00:04:50,530 --> 00:04:52,160
you shouldn't live like I did.

81
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,510
You...

82
00:05:08,250 --> 00:05:10,780
have to live
a happy and respectable life.

83
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,790
As your father,
that's what I want for you.

84
00:05:21,730 --> 00:05:26,230
Let go of me!
This is a setup. I've been framed.

85
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:27,500
Let go.

86
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:33,840
Oh my.

87
00:05:35,770 --> 00:05:37,340
Choi Yu Na really got arrested.

88
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,480
That's right.

89
00:05:39,210 --> 00:05:40,580
Everything went according to plan.

90
00:05:40,850 --> 00:05:42,310
Then, as per our deal,

91
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,480
you'll keep quiet
about Hyun Jun's secret.

92
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:47,620
Don't worry. I'll keep my word.

93
00:05:48,990 --> 00:05:50,720
Now I can finally rest easy.

94
00:05:54,330 --> 00:05:56,290
How is Deputy Chief Yun?

95
00:05:56,290 --> 00:05:58,960
- That's none of your business.
- None of my business?

96
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,900
You brat.

97
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,970
The police will be guarding
Deputy Chief Yun's hospital room.

98
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:09,540
Just in case...

99
00:06:09,710 --> 00:06:11,510
something dangerous happens.

100
00:06:11,510 --> 00:06:13,410
I wouldn't get any funny ideas.

101
00:06:14,810 --> 00:06:16,650
What did I do to deserve this?

102
00:06:17,580 --> 00:06:21,620
In any case, our deal is done.
So just keep your promise.

103
00:06:27,990 --> 00:06:30,600
It seems like this is all over,
doesn't it?

104
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
Yes.

105
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,500
Right. Then let's go see Jin Ju.

106
00:06:37,570 --> 00:06:38,570
Sure.

107
00:06:50,380 --> 00:06:52,920
It was always going
to end like this.

108
00:06:54,350 --> 00:06:56,020
No matter how hard
you try to hide it,

109
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:58,060
the truth always comes out.

110
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:59,660
Don't think you've won.

111
00:07:00,530 --> 00:07:03,190
Park Hyun Jun and I are set
to be married.

112
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:07,370
Once the Adele Group gets involved,
I'll be out of here in no time.

113
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,830
Do you really think that?

114
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:10,330
Or...

115
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,540
are you just putting on
a brave face?

116
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,810
Just you watch.

117
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,970
The Adele Group
can't just abandon me.

118
00:07:17,880 --> 00:07:21,250
Do you know what I gave up
for the chairman?

119
00:07:22,910 --> 00:07:25,280
I made Park Hyun Jun the chairman
with my own two hands.

120
00:07:29,050 --> 00:07:30,720
You still don't get it, do you?

121
00:07:31,660 --> 00:07:32,660
You've...

122
00:07:32,990 --> 00:07:34,530
already been abandoned.

123
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,430
Shut it!

124
00:07:36,690 --> 00:07:38,900
You'll see soon enough.

125
00:07:43,430 --> 00:07:45,400
Baek Jin Ju. Just wait.

126
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:47,140
I'll prove to you...

127
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:48,940
that I'm one
of the Adele Group's people.

128
00:07:53,380 --> 00:07:55,110
- Jin Ju!
- Jin Ju.

129
00:07:55,510 --> 00:07:57,480
You were all so worried,
weren't you?

130
00:07:59,350 --> 00:08:01,050
All that matters is
that you're out now.

131
00:08:01,890 --> 00:08:04,320
Exactly, you've been through a lot.

132
00:08:04,590 --> 00:08:07,460
I know how hard
you all worked for me.

133
00:08:07,890 --> 00:08:08,890
Thank you so much.

134
00:08:08,890 --> 00:08:10,730
Don't mention it.
It's the natural thing to do.

135
00:08:11,330 --> 00:08:12,630
We're a team, after all.

136
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:16,170
Right. Nothing like this
will ever happen again.

137
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:18,940
Oh, right.

138
00:08:19,570 --> 00:08:22,140
Here. Hurry and eat this.

139
00:08:22,210 --> 00:08:23,370
When you're released
from police custody,

140
00:08:23,370 --> 00:08:25,210
you're supposed to eat tofu.

141
00:08:25,740 --> 00:08:27,950
They say it'll keep you
from coming back.

142
00:08:28,010 --> 00:08:31,250
I grilled each piece with love,
so please, eat up.

143
00:08:31,420 --> 00:08:32,620
You shouldn't have.

144
00:08:33,220 --> 00:08:34,220
Thank you.

145
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:37,090
For her, it's the least I could do.

146
00:08:37,690 --> 00:08:39,320
Go on, dig in.

147
00:08:39,590 --> 00:08:40,990
I'll enjoy.

148
00:09:07,890 --> 00:09:08,890
No.

149
00:09:09,650 --> 00:09:11,290
There's no way
I was just thrown away like this.

150
00:09:11,290 --> 00:09:13,760
There's no way
you're getting away with this.

151
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,390
This time,

152
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:17,630
nobody's coming to save you.

153
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:20,770
You've already been abandoned.

154
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:24,040
I've already been abandoned?

155
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:26,040
Already?

156
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:30,210
It can't be.

157
00:09:30,810 --> 00:09:32,510
Did Oh Jung Ran team up with them...

158
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:35,250
to lead me into a trap?

159
00:09:47,930 --> 00:09:49,590
I'm not saying anything.

160
00:09:52,030 --> 00:09:54,770
Contact the Adele Group
and tell them to send me a lawyer.

161
00:09:55,170 --> 00:09:56,500
Oh Jung Ran...

162
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:58,400
No.

163
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:02,840
Let me see Chairman Park Tae Ho.

164
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:05,080
Why are you asking for them here?

165
00:10:06,140 --> 00:10:08,510
Are they involved in this case too?

166
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:10,880
I told you, I'm not saying anything.

167
00:10:15,290 --> 00:10:16,290
Here.

168
00:10:20,690 --> 00:10:22,060
Do you have any proof I did it?

169
00:10:22,930 --> 00:10:24,960
Like you can do anything
without any evidence.

170
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:30,130
The police said Baek Jin Ju's prints
were on the hammer.

171
00:10:30,940 --> 00:10:33,570
The person who tried to kill
Deputy Chief Yun was Baek Jin Ju.

172
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:36,610
You've got some explaining to do
about this.

173
00:10:36,670 --> 00:10:38,010
What about it?

174
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,180
The hammer.

175
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:41,750
You knew exactly
what the weapon was.

176
00:10:42,350 --> 00:10:43,480
How so?

177
00:10:44,150 --> 00:10:46,020
We never released that information.

178
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:47,920
Ms. Choi Yu Na.

179
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:50,620
Tell us the truth.

180
00:10:58,330 --> 00:11:01,770
Should I meet with Assemblyman Kwon
and threaten him again?

181
00:11:03,170 --> 00:11:05,870
Or should I give
the slush fund ledger to Hyun Jun?

182
00:11:07,970 --> 00:11:09,470
Considering
the police investigation,

183
00:11:09,540 --> 00:11:12,110
Hyun Jun has a point.

184
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,950
Still,

185
00:11:15,010 --> 00:11:16,650
something about it...

186
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:20,080
just doesn't feel right.

187
00:11:22,290 --> 00:11:23,290
Honey.

188
00:11:25,090 --> 00:11:26,690
You haven't heard the news,
have you?

189
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:27,930
What news?

190
00:11:28,230 --> 00:11:30,290
Choi Yu Na has been arrested.

191
00:11:30,460 --> 00:11:33,100
She was caught trying
to take out Deputy Chief Yun.

192
00:11:33,100 --> 00:11:34,100
What?

193
00:11:34,700 --> 00:11:35,900
What did you just say?

194
00:11:36,300 --> 00:11:38,070
Those two, Kim Dan Hui
and Park Min Jun,

195
00:11:38,140 --> 00:11:39,970
must've set a trap
and waited for her.

196
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:42,340
What? Honestly!

197
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:45,080
She's completely useless.

198
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:48,550
But still, it's not like
this will affect us.

199
00:11:49,050 --> 00:11:51,280
There's no proof
we ordered her to do it.

200
00:11:51,350 --> 00:11:55,290
Even without proof,
it could make them more suspicious.

201
00:11:55,650 --> 00:11:59,190
- Suspicious about what?
- The detectives came to see me,

202
00:11:59,260 --> 00:12:03,530
asking if anything was going on
with Deputy Chief Yun.

203
00:12:03,930 --> 00:12:05,360
That happened?

204
00:12:05,730 --> 00:12:08,770
If they find another reason
to bother us because of Choi Yu Na,

205
00:12:08,830 --> 00:12:10,100
it'll be a hassle.

206
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,200
Darn it.

207
00:12:17,010 --> 00:12:18,010
You.

208
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,980
You were right.

209
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:23,110
I need to clean up
this police investigation.

210
00:12:23,810 --> 00:12:25,350
Set a meeting with Assemblyman Kwon.

211
00:12:25,650 --> 00:12:27,080
Sure. Then...

212
00:12:27,950 --> 00:12:29,090
what about the slush fund ledger?

213
00:12:31,490 --> 00:12:34,330
I'll handle
this particular deal myself.

214
00:12:34,830 --> 00:12:35,990
As for the slush fund ledger,

215
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:40,000
I'll hand it over
after the inauguration ceremony,

216
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,100
so wait until then.

217
00:12:47,170 --> 00:12:50,040
Choi Yu Na was arrested over
the issue with Deputy Chief Yun.

218
00:12:50,270 --> 00:12:52,240
- I know.
- Will her arrest...

219
00:12:52,510 --> 00:12:54,510
put us back on the police's radar?

220
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:56,850
Enough that we need
Assemblyman Kwon's help?

221
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,750
It's better to be safe than sorry.

222
00:13:02,590 --> 00:13:05,320
If we get Assemblyman Kwon involved,

223
00:13:06,490 --> 00:13:08,560
we could end this
just by burning Choi Yu Na.

224
00:13:26,010 --> 00:13:29,110
I wish I hadn't nagged him
about being a picky eater.

225
00:13:30,310 --> 00:13:32,280
If I'd known
he'd leave us so suddenly,

226
00:13:33,750 --> 00:13:36,990
I would've made him
all the meat dishes he loved.

227
00:13:42,930 --> 00:13:46,860
Why is it that my only child
would rather be anywhere but home?

228
00:13:48,770 --> 00:13:52,300
Maybe it's because of a bad dream,

229
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:55,970
but my mood's been
all over the place all morning.

230
00:14:00,810 --> 00:14:02,050
Gosh, goodness.

231
00:14:02,250 --> 00:14:04,080
Jin Ju, oh my.

232
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:06,180
Were you released
from police custody?

233
00:14:06,350 --> 00:14:07,550
Yes, Ms. Hong.

234
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:11,020
That's such a relief.

235
00:14:11,090 --> 00:14:12,720
I'm so glad things worked out.

236
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:16,460
I knew you would never do
something like that.

237
00:14:16,730 --> 00:14:18,730
But how did you get out?

238
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:21,670
They caught the real culprit.

239
00:14:22,230 --> 00:14:23,330
The real culprit?

240
00:14:23,930 --> 00:14:27,540
What kind of lowlife punk
would frame you like that?

241
00:14:27,910 --> 00:14:30,440
I swear, I'll tear that scum
limb from limb...

242
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:31,510
What?

243
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:35,480
It was Yu Na, Ms. Hong.

244
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:37,980
What?

245
00:14:38,820 --> 00:14:39,880
What do you mean...

246
00:14:41,050 --> 00:14:42,050
it was...

247
00:14:42,490 --> 00:14:43,690
Yu Na?

248
00:14:45,290 --> 00:14:47,520
The person
who actually tried to kill...

249
00:14:47,630 --> 00:14:48,960
Deputy Chief Yun...

250
00:14:50,490 --> 00:14:51,500
was Yu Na.

251
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:55,730
My gosh.

252
00:14:56,370 --> 00:14:58,970
My Yu Na...

253
00:15:00,140 --> 00:15:02,070
Wait. My Yu Na?

254
00:15:03,540 --> 00:15:05,810
You asked me to look after her,

255
00:15:07,140 --> 00:15:08,150
and I'm sorry.

256
00:15:08,750 --> 00:15:09,750
Yu Na...

257
00:15:10,410 --> 00:15:12,620
I think she's gone too far.

258
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,990
What am I going to do?

259
00:15:15,050 --> 00:15:16,090
Ms. Hong.

260
00:15:17,090 --> 00:15:19,520
- This way.
- Oh my goodness.

261
00:15:19,890 --> 00:15:22,460
What is happening? Oh my.

262
00:15:23,090 --> 00:15:25,300
Sam Sik, what am I supposed to do?

263
00:15:26,100 --> 00:15:27,900
I'll get you some water.

264
00:15:28,300 --> 00:15:29,300
Wait.

265
00:15:29,370 --> 00:15:33,040
So, where is my Yu Na now?

266
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:39,710
Goodness. Yu Na!

267
00:15:40,340 --> 00:15:44,320
Mom, help me. Get me out of here.

268
00:15:44,750 --> 00:15:47,450
Look at the state you're in.

269
00:15:48,450 --> 00:15:51,160
Did you really try
to kill someone again?

270
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:54,690
Isn't it enough
that you hurt CEO Baek and Jin Ju?

271
00:15:55,460 --> 00:15:58,000
What other monstrous thing
did you do?

272
00:15:59,330 --> 00:16:01,100
I'll explain everything
when I get out.

273
00:16:01,470 --> 00:16:03,970
First, just help me get out of here.

274
00:16:04,170 --> 00:16:06,200
What am I going to do with you?

275
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:09,110
Go to Oh Jung Ran right now
and tell her to get me out.

276
00:16:09,570 --> 00:16:11,040
Tell her if she leaves me in here,

277
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:12,710
I'll expose her secret.

278
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,650
Her secret?

279
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:17,450
She'll know what it means
if you just say that.

280
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:20,280
Hurry up and threaten her. Hurry!

281
00:16:20,650 --> 00:16:22,490
Oh, honestly.

282
00:16:25,060 --> 00:16:27,390
What? My secret?

283
00:16:28,090 --> 00:16:29,290
That's right.

284
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:31,730
If you don't get Yu Na out of there,

285
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:35,300
she's going to reveal
that secret or whatever it is.

286
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:37,740
If you catch her drift,
you'd better get moving.

287
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:41,940
And did you happen to hear
what this secret is?

288
00:16:44,070 --> 00:16:46,010
Well, it's...

289
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:49,210
I don't know
what kind of secret it is,

290
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:52,020
but I can tell
it's extremely important to you.

291
00:16:53,020 --> 00:16:56,450
Anyway, Yu Na knows all about it.

292
00:16:56,550 --> 00:17:00,220
So you have to do whatever it takes
to get my daughter out.

293
00:17:00,220 --> 00:17:01,660
In other words, you're clueless.

294
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,530
That's a relief.

295
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:08,470
(Bit Life President, Oh Jung Ran)

296
00:17:08,530 --> 00:17:10,170
It's for the best...

297
00:17:11,070 --> 00:17:12,600
that you never find out what it is.

298
00:17:14,410 --> 00:17:16,270
And go tell Choi Yu Na this.

299
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:17,810
If she runs her mouth,

300
00:17:18,310 --> 00:17:21,180
her attempted murder will end up
as a murder charge.

301
00:17:22,150 --> 00:17:24,920
If she doesn't want to meet
a nasty end in prison,

302
00:17:24,980 --> 00:17:26,520
tell her to shut her mouth
and lay low.

303
00:17:28,850 --> 00:17:31,820
- Wait.
- What are you doing?

304
00:17:31,990 --> 00:17:33,020
Please.

305
00:17:34,830 --> 00:17:36,090
Just help her this one time.

306
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:39,060
I...

307
00:17:39,700 --> 00:17:42,730
I'll make sure
Yu Na keeps her mouth shut,

308
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:44,300
so please...

309
00:17:45,300 --> 00:17:47,170
Please help her, just this once.

310
00:17:47,670 --> 00:17:49,210
I'm begging you.

311
00:17:49,340 --> 00:17:52,210
Please get Yu Na out.

312
00:17:52,510 --> 00:17:55,210
It's not like we forced her
to try and kill him.

313
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:56,650
She went out of her way...

314
00:17:56,650 --> 00:17:58,880
and got caught
while trying to kill someone.

315
00:17:59,150 --> 00:18:00,980
Why come to me to get her out?

316
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,290
Get your own daughter out yourself.

317
00:18:04,820 --> 00:18:05,890
Wait.

318
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:11,090
What's going to happen
to my daughter?

319
00:18:11,930 --> 00:18:14,630
It seems like
there's no way out now.

320
00:18:15,230 --> 00:18:18,800
What do I do about this? Oh dear.

321
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:33,380
Jin Ju.

322
00:18:34,450 --> 00:18:36,550
Can we talk?

323
00:18:40,490 --> 00:18:41,560
Ms. Hong.

324
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,590
My goodness, Jin Ju.

325
00:18:44,460 --> 00:18:45,800
You said you were going
to see Yu Na.

326
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:47,230
What are you doing here?

327
00:18:48,670 --> 00:18:50,730
Yu Na told me to come,

328
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:54,370
so I came, clutching at straws.

329
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:56,240
But it's hopeless.

330
00:18:57,310 --> 00:18:59,810
What am I going to do about her now?

331
00:19:03,850 --> 00:19:05,920
No matter how much I think about it,

332
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:09,090
you're the only one
I can turn to for help.

333
00:19:09,950 --> 00:19:11,860
Please, Jin Ju.

334
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:17,360
Couldn't you please
get Yu Na out of there?

335
00:19:19,900 --> 00:19:22,300
Wait. What on earth am I saying?

336
00:19:23,300 --> 00:19:24,800
Yu Na's the reason...

337
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:27,500
you went through that ordeal
with the police.

338
00:19:27,910 --> 00:19:31,940
Goodness. I'm just so desperate
that I was just saying things.

339
00:19:33,310 --> 00:19:36,150
You should go home now.
I'll take you.

340
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:37,880
Okay.

341
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,720
If only Yu Na...

342
00:19:40,750 --> 00:19:44,520
were as thoughtful as you are.

343
00:19:45,090 --> 00:19:46,460
I'm sorry, Jin Ju.

344
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:49,690
I'm sorry I didn't raise her better.

345
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:51,830
Let's go.

346
00:19:52,330 --> 00:19:53,330
Okay.

347
00:19:58,770 --> 00:20:00,740
The police investigation
has gotten a bit complicated.

348
00:20:02,870 --> 00:20:04,880
Please give Assemblyman Kwon
a message.

349
00:20:06,940 --> 00:20:08,050
Assemblyman Kwon?

350
00:20:13,250 --> 00:20:14,250
Assemblyman Kwon?

351
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:16,650
Yes. It looks like Park Tae Ho...

352
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:18,520
is trying to meet
with Assemblyman Kwon again.

353
00:20:19,190 --> 00:20:21,260
He was already anxious
about the police investigation,

354
00:20:21,330 --> 00:20:23,190
and now that Choi Yu Na
has been arrested,

355
00:20:23,260 --> 00:20:24,560
he must be getting nervous.

356
00:20:25,560 --> 00:20:28,100
If he blackmails him
with the slush fund ledger again,

357
00:20:28,230 --> 00:20:30,200
the police investigation
will be blocked again.

358
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:32,200
We have to stop it somehow.

359
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:36,370
I have to get to Assemblyman Kwon
before Park Tae Ho does.

360
00:20:36,740 --> 00:20:38,580
Are you going to try
to persuade Assemblyman Kwon?

361
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:40,110
I'm going to use Assemblyman Kwon...

362
00:20:40,510 --> 00:20:42,310
to try and get
the slush fund ledger.

363
00:20:42,850 --> 00:20:44,510
The slush fund ledger?

364
00:20:56,090 --> 00:20:59,930
Should I call you Kim Myung Hui,
or Kim Dan Hui?

365
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:01,800
What did you want to talk about...

366
00:21:02,270 --> 00:21:04,070
that you had to pull
your Ihwachae connections...

367
00:21:04,070 --> 00:21:05,270
to get me here?

368
00:21:05,570 --> 00:21:08,470
You're being blackmailed
by Park Tae Ho, aren't you?

369
00:21:09,010 --> 00:21:11,110
He's holding his ledger
over your head.

370
00:21:13,610 --> 00:21:17,810
If you let him lead you around,
it'll get in my way.

371
00:21:18,750 --> 00:21:21,550
Lead me around?
What do you take me for?

372
00:21:23,090 --> 00:21:25,620
He probably reached out
to meet you again.

373
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:28,330
He wants you to stop
the police investigation.

374
00:21:28,390 --> 00:21:29,930
So why not use this opportunity...

375
00:21:30,590 --> 00:21:33,060
to cut ties with Park Tae Ho?

376
00:21:34,300 --> 00:21:36,400
Cut ties with him?

377
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:41,470
If you're interested,
I could give you some advice.

378
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:49,950
What? What did you just say?

379
00:21:50,350 --> 00:21:53,020
Assemblyman Kwon is making demands?

380
00:21:53,180 --> 00:21:54,180
Yes.

381
00:21:54,250 --> 00:21:55,690
He'll make sure
the police investigation...

382
00:21:55,690 --> 00:21:57,150
ends with Choi Yu Na,

383
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:59,090
but you have to bring
the slush fund ledger...

384
00:21:59,190 --> 00:22:00,620
and let him erase his name from it.

385
00:22:00,820 --> 00:22:02,760
He wants to watch you do it himself.

386
00:22:02,930 --> 00:22:05,700
He doesn't want to be blackmailed
over the slush fund ledger anymore,

387
00:22:05,700 --> 00:22:07,100
and this is going to be
the last time.

388
00:22:07,960 --> 00:22:09,400
That's what I think he's getting at.

389
00:22:11,270 --> 00:22:14,100
He's taken countless
sums of money from me,

390
00:22:14,340 --> 00:22:17,510
and now he says
this is the last time he'll help me?

391
00:22:18,010 --> 00:22:19,510
That shameless geezer.

392
00:22:20,210 --> 00:22:22,680
So are you going to refuse?

393
00:22:25,450 --> 00:22:29,020
Either way, you can't
just leave the investigation as is.

394
00:22:29,150 --> 00:22:31,460
We don't know
what Choi Yu Na might say.

395
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:34,090
And it's not like he's the only one
in the slush fund ledger.

396
00:22:34,460 --> 00:22:37,090
We'll just use Assemblyman Kwon
one last time.

397
00:22:38,330 --> 00:22:39,330
All right.

398
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:43,100
Set up a meeting
for tonight immediately.

399
00:23:12,730 --> 00:23:14,560
I heard from Min Jun.

400
00:23:14,970 --> 00:23:17,000
He said Assemblyman Kwon
and Park Tae Ho met.

401
00:23:17,600 --> 00:23:20,340
Okay. Let's get going too.

402
00:23:20,340 --> 00:23:23,770
Let's move. It's been a while
since I've seen some action.

403
00:23:23,840 --> 00:23:26,480
Never mind that.
You need to lay low.

404
00:23:26,540 --> 00:23:29,250
The main thing for you two today
is not getting caught.

405
00:23:29,250 --> 00:23:32,320
Don't worry.
I'm much quicker than I look.

406
00:23:33,750 --> 00:23:35,850
- Let's go.
- Boss, are you heading out again?

407
00:23:36,090 --> 00:23:39,190
Na Yeon, can you handle
closing up again today?

408
00:23:39,260 --> 00:23:40,690
As long as you're paying me double,
of course.

409
00:23:40,760 --> 00:23:43,290
- Okay. Let's go.
- All right, let's move.

410
00:23:53,370 --> 00:23:54,570
Mrs. Han.

411
00:23:54,870 --> 00:23:57,410
Park Tae Ho's at the meeting
with the slush fund ledger.

412
00:23:59,180 --> 00:24:00,180
Yes.

413
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:03,150
Please have everything ready
like I asked.

414
00:24:04,280 --> 00:24:06,720
What about my demand?

415
00:24:12,090 --> 00:24:14,790
I brought it right here.

416
00:24:16,090 --> 00:24:17,760
If you make the call to the police,

417
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:21,100
we'll delete your records
right here and now.

418
00:24:21,430 --> 00:24:23,630
Then let me take a look first.

419
00:24:25,940 --> 00:24:26,940
Here.

420
00:24:41,690 --> 00:24:44,150
Can I trust
that there are no copies?

421
00:24:44,450 --> 00:24:45,660
Assemblyman Kwon,

422
00:24:46,420 --> 00:24:48,630
I'm Park Tae Ho of Adele Group.

423
00:24:49,660 --> 00:24:51,900
I don't stoop to such dirty tricks.

424
00:24:52,760 --> 00:24:55,000
Blackmailing someone
with a ledger like this...

425
00:24:55,070 --> 00:24:56,530
is a dirty trick in itself.

426
00:24:57,470 --> 00:24:59,900
Seriously? Assemblyman Kwon!

427
00:25:01,370 --> 00:25:04,340
Now that you've verified it,
please make the call.

428
00:25:10,580 --> 00:25:12,050
Hey, it's me.

429
00:25:12,950 --> 00:25:14,220
Proceed as planned.

430
00:25:20,390 --> 00:25:22,090
- What?
- What's going on?

431
00:25:22,190 --> 00:25:23,530
What is this?

432
00:25:25,360 --> 00:25:26,830
Assemblyman Kwon, you scumbag!

433
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:30,300
How dare you stab me in the back
and go after the ledger?

434
00:25:30,370 --> 00:25:32,700
You're the one
who stabbed me in the back.

435
00:25:32,800 --> 00:25:34,540
You told me not to worry
when you gave me the money,

436
00:25:34,540 --> 00:25:36,440
but then you kept a ledger
to blackmail me?

437
00:25:36,610 --> 00:25:40,140
Do you think a threat like this
would make me bend to your will?

438
00:25:41,010 --> 00:25:43,950
Let go of me. Hey. Get in here, now!

439
00:25:44,250 --> 00:25:46,250
Let go. How dare you?

440
00:25:46,450 --> 00:25:47,450
Let go of it!

441
00:25:47,950 --> 00:25:48,950
What?

442
00:25:49,420 --> 00:25:50,420
You little...

443
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:52,160
Let go, darn it!

444
00:25:53,320 --> 00:25:55,860
- How dare you stab me in the back?
- Let go!

445
00:25:57,390 --> 00:25:58,400
Give it here.

446
00:25:58,660 --> 00:25:59,700
Let go.

447
00:26:01,230 --> 00:26:02,470
- Let go!
- I said let go.

448
00:26:02,530 --> 00:26:03,970
You ungrateful fool!

449
00:26:05,140 --> 00:26:06,570
What the...

450
00:26:07,340 --> 00:26:08,870
Hey, what is this?

451
00:26:08,940 --> 00:26:10,040
Let go. This...

452
00:26:11,570 --> 00:26:12,710
- What?
- What was that?

453
00:26:12,780 --> 00:26:13,780
Where did it go?

454
00:26:14,110 --> 00:26:16,510
What? Don't just stand there.

455
00:26:16,510 --> 00:26:18,950
- Get him now, you punks!
- Get him!

456
00:26:19,180 --> 00:26:20,950
What the heck is this?

457
00:26:21,050 --> 00:26:23,490
You just wait. You son of a...

458
00:26:23,720 --> 00:26:24,720
Why you...

459
00:26:27,290 --> 00:26:28,330
Park Min Jun!

460
00:26:33,860 --> 00:26:34,860
What?

461
00:26:35,100 --> 00:26:37,170
Hey, go after him now!

462
00:26:37,630 --> 00:26:39,700
You have to stop him
from handing over the ledger.

463
00:26:40,100 --> 00:26:41,710
Stop him. Hurry.

464
00:26:42,710 --> 00:26:43,710
Hurry!

465
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:51,950
Don't just stand there!

466
00:27:18,510 --> 00:27:19,840
Park Min Jun!

467
00:27:21,510 --> 00:27:22,750
It's game over.

468
00:27:24,380 --> 00:27:25,750
- Min Jun.
- Hey.

469
00:27:27,550 --> 00:27:28,750
I'm counting on you.

470
00:27:29,890 --> 00:27:30,890
Okay.

471
00:27:32,290 --> 00:27:33,290
Let's go.

472
00:27:35,690 --> 00:27:36,690
What?

473
00:27:40,260 --> 00:27:42,900
I'm not the one with the ledger.

474
00:27:48,770 --> 00:27:50,770
Honestly.

475
00:27:51,110 --> 00:27:55,480
Darn it. Why isn't Hyun Jun
answering his phone?

476
00:27:55,580 --> 00:27:58,420
Why would you make our Hyun Jun
do something so dangerous?

477
00:27:58,480 --> 00:28:00,480
Is this really the time
to argue about that?

478
00:28:00,820 --> 00:28:03,050
We're done for
if we lose that ledger.

479
00:28:03,050 --> 00:28:04,950
- Father!
- Hyun Jun.

480
00:28:05,090 --> 00:28:07,290
Are you okay?
You're not hurt, are you?

481
00:28:07,290 --> 00:28:09,660
The ledger?
What happened to the ledger?

482
00:28:09,760 --> 00:28:12,300
Father, did you see anyone else
in the restaurant or the parking lot?

483
00:28:12,430 --> 00:28:13,560
What are you talking about?

484
00:28:13,560 --> 00:28:16,000
Park Min Jun wasn't the one
who had the ledger.

485
00:28:16,730 --> 00:28:18,670
He didn't have it.

486
00:28:18,940 --> 00:28:21,140
What? What did you just say?

487
00:28:24,940 --> 00:28:27,010
What? Hold on.

488
00:28:27,880 --> 00:28:31,480
Wait, who are you people?

489
00:28:31,820 --> 00:28:33,120
We're from the Prosecutors' Office.

490
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:36,450
We're here to execute
a search and seizure warrant.

491
00:28:36,520 --> 00:28:38,290
A search and seizure?

492
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:40,160
This is regarding
a violation of the Act...

493
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,830
on the Aggravated Punishment
of Specific Economic Crimes...

494
00:28:42,060 --> 00:28:43,830
and charges of bribery.

495
00:28:47,200 --> 00:28:49,900
So this is about the slush fund?

496
00:28:49,900 --> 00:28:51,230
Yes, we've already
secured the ledger.

497
00:28:51,230 --> 00:28:53,540
So please cooperate.
All right, let's begin!

498
00:28:53,540 --> 00:28:55,740
What? Hey, where are you going?

499
00:28:55,740 --> 00:28:58,640
Where do you think you're going?
Look here.

500
00:28:58,640 --> 00:29:01,210
Cut this out right now!

501
00:29:03,150 --> 00:29:04,980
What?

502
00:29:06,380 --> 00:29:08,490
These punks... Hey!

503
00:29:10,490 --> 00:29:11,490
Darn them.

504
00:29:17,830 --> 00:29:19,430
Hyun Jun, hey!

505
00:29:19,860 --> 00:29:22,730
What on earth just happened?

506
00:29:23,530 --> 00:29:25,270
Park Min Jun tricked us.

507
00:29:26,270 --> 00:29:28,870
He got someone else to hand the ledger
over to the prosecution.

508
00:29:29,510 --> 00:29:32,810
I think him trying to run
was just to buy time.

509
00:29:33,510 --> 00:29:34,910
Park Min Jun...

510
00:29:35,310 --> 00:29:36,980
Then what's going to happen now?

511
00:29:37,910 --> 00:29:39,350
What about the company?

512
00:30:14,080 --> 00:30:17,050
(Pearl in Red)

513
00:30:17,050 --> 00:30:18,250
Kim Dan Hui.

514
00:30:18,250 --> 00:30:21,930
You stole the slush fund ledger
and gave it to the prosecution?

515
00:30:22,090 --> 00:30:25,160
There's nothing you can use anymore.

516
00:30:25,330 --> 00:30:28,030
That dirty money that protected you,

517
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:31,230
and the power you had, are all gone.

518
00:30:31,400 --> 00:30:33,800
Park Tae Ho will have a hard time
getting out of this.

519
00:30:33,870 --> 00:30:37,310
We'll use this chance
to take over his stocks and assets.

520
00:30:37,410 --> 00:30:40,510
Whatever your plan is,
it won't go your way.

521
00:30:40,580 --> 00:30:43,180
There's no escaping the law
this time.

522
00:30:43,180 --> 00:30:44,780
See how far you can push this.

523
00:30:44,980 --> 00:30:46,250
Whether Chairman Park Tae Ho...

524
00:30:46,250 --> 00:30:48,220
ends up dragged off
by the prosecution or not,

525
00:30:48,420 --> 00:30:49,490
I'd like to see that for myself.

